    },
    "To enable notifications, please go to Settings and allow notifications for this app." : {

    },
    "To play the game, just enter a valid word and submit your guess. After each guess, the colors of the tiles will show how close you were." : {

    },
    "To play the game, just enter a valid word and submit your guess. The game will highlight correct letters in green, correct letters in the wrong position in orange, and unused letters in gray." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para jugar, solo ingresa una palabra válida y realiza una adivinar. El juego resaltará las letras correctas en verde, las letras correctas en la posición incorrecta en naranja y las letras no usadas en gris."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For å spille spillet, bare skriv inn et gyldig ord og trykk på VELG ORD knappen. Spillet vil fremheve riktige bokstaver med grønne, riktige bokstaver i feil posisjon i oransje og feil bokstaver i grått."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To start a game, select a language and the number of letters in the word that you are going to guess. After that, you choose the gamemode, either Normal or Daily Word." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para iniciar un juego, selecciona un idioma y el número de letras de la palabra que vas a adivinar. Después, elige el modo de juego, ya sea Normal o Palabra Diaria."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For å starte et spill, velg et språk og antall bokstaver i ordet du skal gjette. Etter det velger du en spillmodus, enten Normal eller Daglig Ord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
